<h2 id="browser-support">Browser support</h2>
<p>NSW Design System is supported in the following browsers:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Chrome (latest)</li>
  <li>Safari (latest)</li>
  <li>Microsoft Edge (latest)</li>
  <li>Firefox (latest)</li>
</ul>


